  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Food Security and Livelihoods, Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on Di Moody Nakuruto WASH Project and Cash for Health in Emergencies (COVID-19) response, scale-up of activities in Taita Teveta county as an integrated food security and livelihoods intervention. Activities;&#xA0;
- Food security and livelihoods; promotion of modern farming, links to market, financial inclusion, CVA, DRR initiatives, health, and nutrition-sensitive programming&#xA0;&#xA0;
- WASH; water pipelines, hygiene and sanitation promotion&#xA0;
- COVID-19 sensitization&#xA0;
- Linking humanitarian assistance to Government Social Protection</narrative>
  </description>
